# The linuxdeploy copies tools/package_linux.sh makes the packages with:
# sha256, then the name the script asks for. Any other copy is refused unless
# SMD_DGX_ANY_LINUXDEPLOY=1. The script downloads neither.
#
# These are GitHub "continuous" builds, which that page replaces with every
# new build, so a new download will not match. Pin the new copy here in the
# same commit that changes what the packages contain.
#
# linuxdeploy 1-alpha, git commit 07333c6, GitHub Actions build 373,
# built 2026-11-01; AppImage runtime type2-runtime fedfad5.
